OL,3,AGreens call for temporary ban on new
OL,4,Adata centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanski has called for a freeze
OL,7,Fon the approval of new data centres in
OL,8,FEngland because of concerns about the
OL,9,Famount of water and energy they use.
OL,11,FThe Green Party leader said the
OL,12,Fgovernment should introduce stricter
OL,13,Fenvironmental rules and give
OL,14,Fcommunities more say on whether the
OL,15,Fcentres are built in their area.
OL,17,FData centres can use significant
OL,18,Famounts of water to cool their systems,
OL,19,Falthough there are no official figures
OL,20,Fon how much water they consume in the
OL,21,FUK.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
