OL,3,AGreens call for temporary ban on new
OL,4,Adata centres
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said a pause would lead
OL,7,Fto the UK losing investment and being
OL,8,Fdependent on overseas computing for
OL,9,Fsensitive data processing.
